// Publisher is the service-protocol that publisher peer services
// implement. Sensors are one kind of publisher; the four bundled
// sensors (sensors/sensor-cron, sensors/sensor-http,
// sensors/sensor-object-store, sensors/sensor-webhook) all implement
// this protocol.
//
// Rimsky's control-api drives publisher lifecycle at instance create /
// terminate via Subscribe / Unsubscribe, and reconciles publisher state
// after a rimsky restart via ListSubscriptions.
//
// Publishers POST message envelopes to the generic
// POST /instances/{instance_id}/messages endpoint with
// sender_kind="publisher" + publisher_subscription_id capability token.
// There is no special observation deposit endpoint.
//
// Per spec
// .ok-planner/specs/2026-05-17-sensor-messaging-unification-design.md
// §Publisher protocol unification.

